# MG5_aMC v3.5 standalone resonant W+Z -> e+ ve mu+ mu- amplitude.
# Research purpose: independent full spin-correlated 2->4 ME tests of
# signed W/Z decay-plane azimuthal interference, not a collider simulation.
# MSSM_SLHA2 first-generation left squarks are electroweak proxies for
# the scalar SU(2)_L doublet; they carry QCD, not infracolor.
# Must use a compact SLHA card matching the 2->2 scalar benchmark and
# NONZERO physical W/Z widths: zero widths at exact on-shell resonances
# make the 2->4 Breit-Wigner amplitude singular.
# Output is new standalone folder, leaving 2->2 validations untouched.
set gauge unitary
import model MSSM_SLHA2
generate ul dl~ > w+ z QCD=0 QED=2, w+ > e+ ve, z > mu+ mu-
output standalone MG5_UL_DL_WZ_3LNU -f
